--- WEB SOURCE PARITY (the spec) ---
AddressInput({ value, onChange, onSelect, placeholder, label }) is a thin wrapper over the shared
@/components/forms <Combobox> wired as an async geocode autocomplete. Hooks: useTranslation + useGeocodeSearch.
  * leading <MapPin/> glyph; free-text field whose RAW text the parent owns (value / onChange).
  * 400ms debounce: value -> debouncedQuery; useGeocodeSearch(debouncedQuery) enabled only when length >= 3
      -> GET /geocode/search?q=${encodeURIComponent(query)}&limit=5 -> GeocodeResult[] ({display_name,lat,lng}),
      select: safeArray, staleTime: SLOW.
  * loading={isLoading && debouncedQuery.length >= 3}; options={results ?? []}; maxVisibleOptions=5; allowFreeText.
  * getOptionLabel=(r)=>r.display_name ; getOptionKey=(r)=>`${r.lat}-${r.lng}-${r.display_name}`.
  * renderOption: <MapPin/> + <span class="line-clamp-2">{display_name}</span>.
  * choosing a suggestion -> onChange(display_name) + onSelect({lat,lng,name=display_name}).
  * label = label ?? t('addressInput.label','Address') ; hideLabel = !label  (the ONLY i18n key in source).

--- NATIVE REPRODUCTION ---
4-file surface mirroring the established XRayHeader Source/ViewModel/Model/view split (P1/S8 state-holder seam):
  * AddressInput.Source.cs  : IAddressGeocodeSource + AddressGeocodeSource — one cache-then-network read via the
      shared CacheThenNetworkEngine on generated op get_api_v1_geocode_search, query {q, limit} (snake_case,
      URL-encoded verbatim — the endpoint declares no typed query params so BuildQuery passes them through),
      raw JSON cached losslessly, mapped to RepositoryResult<IReadOnlyList<GeocodeSuggestion>>. No HTTP in the view.
  * AddressInput.Model.cs   : GeocodeSuggestion(.FromJson, OptionKey), GeocodeSuggestions(.FromJsonArray/.IsEmpty,
      tolerant of non-array + blank rows), AddressSelection (web TripLocation), AddressInputState (Idle/Loading/
      Ready/Empty/Stale/Offline/Error), AddressInputProjection (OptionLabel/OptionKey + MeetsMinLength gate),
      AddressGeocodeResultMapper, AddressInputRegistration (slug, MinQueryLength=3, DebounceMilliseconds=400,
      DefaultLimit=5, MapPin glyph, copy), AddressInputDiagnostics.
  * AddressInput.ViewModel.cs: UI-thread-free INPC state machine. SetQueryAsync gates on MeetsMinLength (web
      enabled:length>=3) -> Idle with NO source call; otherwise one cache-then-network read classified into the
      full matrix; Supersede() cancels the prior in-flight query per keystroke; RetryAsync / Clear.
  * AddressInput.cs         : WinUI 3 view. The native counterpart of the web <Combobox> is the Fluent
      AutoSuggestBox (the same primitive the atomic TsCombobox wraps) — used directly because the atomic
      TsCombobox is a static, self-filtering, single-VALUE picker and cannot express this surface's async,
      free-text, parent-owned-value contract. Composition: leading MapPin (Narrator-hidden) + AutoSuggestBox
      (per-row MapPin + 2-line-clamped display_name via an XamlReader ItemTemplate, TextMemberPath=DisplayName);
      400ms DispatcherQueueTimer debounce; status row (searching ProgressRing / no-matches / stale chip / offline
      chip / error+retry); polite LiveRegion. DPs Value (two-way, web value) + Label (web label/hideLabel) +
      PromptText (web placeholder prop — named per the TsCombobox/TsSearchInput convention); events ValueChanged
      (web onChange) + LocationSelected (web onSelect). Create() factory wires the repository source.
  * states (ALL render — no hidden surface): Idle (query < 3, resting; web hook disabled) / Loading (searching
      spinner) / Ready (suggestions) / Empty (no matches) / Stale (chip, auto-refresh) / Offline (cached + chip) /
      Error (inline message + Retry). error/stale/offline/empty are the native superset the cache-then-network
      layer can produce; the web Combobox owns loading + the option list, its parent owns the rest.
  * i18n: the one web-source key addressInput.label ("Address") is present in the P1/S10 catalog as
      translation.addressInput.label in Strings/{en,ar,he}/Resources.resw. The native-superset state copy
      (searching/noMatches/typeMore/stale/offline/retry/error/offlineMessage) resolves to its English fallback
      when absent — the same precedent the sibling TripPlannerMap / XRayHeader surfaces follow.
  * a11y: AutoSuggestBox always carries a Narrator name (label ?? "Address", even when the visible label is
      hidden); retry button + decorative map-pins (AccessibilityView=Raw) handled; state changes announced via a
      polite LiveRegion; no custom motion (reduced-motion honoured by construction).
  * Telemetry: view.opened slug=AddressInput emitted once on Loaded (P1/S11), PII-safe (never logs the typed
      query, an address or a coordinate).

